{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.poster.avif?t=1769482622\" width=650 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.webm?t=1769482622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.mp4?t=1769482622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarleth, an action RPG and adventure game with elements of alchemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Adventure Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After awakening in a cold sweat from a nightmare that felt all too real, <strong>Leth</strong>, the young protagonist of this story, is interrupted by the arrival of <strong>Iqnus</strong>, a valiant knight of the Kingdom of Scarleth. With a grave expression and a voice heavy with urgency, Iqnus delivers the dreadful news: Leth\u2019s sister has been captured by enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With little time to process the shock, Leth knows there is no room for hesitation. His path will lead him to the <strong>frozen, distant land of Florencia</strong>, a harsh and mysterious realm blanketed in snow, where his sister awaits in captivity. There, amid blizzards and hidden perils, he must face challenges that will test not only his strength but also his resolve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Game features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> A vast world to explore!</strong> Dive into a land full of secrets, mysteries, villages, and enemies to face on your journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Accessories and items!</strong> Mythical and sacred elements that allow you to play with your preferred strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Discover powerful alchemies! </strong> Combine different resources to create magical powers. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Uncover all the secrets!</strong> A mountain of secrets everywhere!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Leveling and upgrade system!</strong> You can level up and improve your weapons and armor in exchange for gold pieces at a blacksmith.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Full compatibility with Xbox controller!</strong> You can control the game however you prefer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1546760?t=1769482622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769482622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/c190b93eac2384d19a1b0124974d192f8835519b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769482622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/c190b93eac2384d19a1b0124974d192f8835519b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769482622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.poster.avif?t=1769482622\" width=650 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.webm?t=1769482622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.mp4?t=1769482622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarleth, an action RPG and adventure game with elements of alchemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Adventure Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After awakening in a cold sweat from a nightmare that felt all too real, <strong>Leth</strong>, the young protagonist of this story, is interrupted by the arrival of <strong>Iqnus</strong>, a valiant knight of the Kingdom of Scarleth. With a grave expression and a voice heavy with urgency, Iqnus delivers the dreadful news: Leth\u2019s sister has been captured by enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With little time to process the shock, Leth knows there is no room for hesitation. His path will lead him to the <strong>frozen, distant land of Florencia</strong>, a harsh and mysterious realm blanketed in snow, where his sister awaits in captivity. There, amid blizzards and hidden perils, he must face challenges that will test not only his strength but also his resolve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Game features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> A vast world to explore!</strong> Dive into a land full of secrets, mysteries, villages, and enemies to face on your journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Accessories and items!</strong> Mythical and sacred elements that allow you to play with your preferred strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Discover powerful alchemies! </strong> Combine different resources to create magical powers. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Uncover all the secrets!</strong> A mountain of secrets everywhere!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Leveling and upgrade system!</strong> You can level up and improve your weapons and armor in exchange for gold pieces at a blacksmith.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Full compatibility with Xbox controller!</strong> You can control the game however you prefer.</p></li></ul>","developers":["evenyth"],"dlc":[3520740],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/header.jpg?t=1769482622","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Scarleth \u00a9 evenyth 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.7 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 mb video memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.7 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 mb video memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1546760/281694129/fb7cd8c6ff63ec73c2de397533026ad3e53e82d4/1755658094/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759103320","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1546760/281694129/fb7cd8c6ff63ec73c2de397533026ad3e53e82d4/1755658094/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759103320","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1546760/281694129/fb7cd8c6ff63ec73c2de397533026ad3e53e82d4/1755658094/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759103320","id":2571